cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Hybrid classical-quantum breast cancer classification: code release for the
  IDC histopathology and tabular WBCD studies
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below. If you refer
  to the histopathology study specifically, cite the article reporting it and the
  paper-b-v1.0 release tag.
