abstract: >-
  Training, evaluation, and analysis code for hybrid classical-quantum breast
  cancer classification. The histopathology study evaluates a bolt-on
  variational quantum head against capacity-controlled classical baselines on
  Kaggle Breast Histopathology Images under case-ID-grouped five-fold
  cross-validation, and reports a null result. The release includes the
  case-level fold manifests both partitions depend on, the protocols declared
  before the confirmatory runs, and a script that re-derives the width-matrix
  claims from the raw run artifacts. Patch images are not redistributed.
